  "description": "Dillon Marshall Property Consultants proudly present O’Neill Court, an exclusive residential development nestled in the heart of Belmayne, Dublin 13. Offering generously sized 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, this modern community combines elegant living spaces with an enviable location that caters to every lifestyle. O’Neill Court offers unparalleled access to a wealth of local amenities, recreational facilities, and natural beauty. Residents will enjoy a tranquil private landscaped courtyard and gardens, complete with a children’s play area and comfortable seating. Ground-floor apartments boast sun-filled private terraces, perfect for unwinding. Located just 500m from both local restaurants and shops and Clarehall Shopping Centre (with Tesco Extra) and 3km from Baldoyle Village, O’Neill Court provides easy access to a variety of retail, dining, and leisure options. Whether you're shopping for essentials, dining out, or seeking entertainment, everything you need is close at hand. One of the standout features of O’Neill Court is its close proximity to both Malahide and Howth, picturesque coastal villages renowned for their scenic walking trails, vibrant seafood restaurants, and breathtaking views.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe particulars detailed here are to represent the development only. Visual representations, finishes, layouts and/or scales may be approximate or representative of the development rather than the exact specifications of the actual unit. The landlord reserves the right to make alterations to the design and specification in the overall interest of the development",
